{"author":{"id":"038d65070aa747b6bc9d50939fa697ec871a40ed259db54429b255bbef2581d6"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1793652099,"nonce":"PyiTzGJrRQeCicjIGz7MhKs3U70=","message":"Implemented gateway-only policy for synced image and toolchain guests, preserving deny-all networking for ordinary repository workspaces. syncGateway.guestUrl can map a host-local fetch endpoint to a guest-reachable HTTPS gateway; malformed URLs, wildcard hosts and guest loopback destinations are refused. Real NUC test on MSB 0.7.11 used restricted multi-tenant mode with --no-net and allow@example.com: example.com:443 connected, cloudflare.com:443 and 1.1.1.1:443 were blocked, and the exact test VM was removed. This verifies MSB egress enforcement; full authenticated publication against a deployed gateway remains unverified.","files":null}]}